<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73897" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμο-φρονέω</span></b> , pf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡμοφρόνηκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Mus.</u>
					p.86
				</span></i>
			 K.:—<i>to be of the same mind, have the same
				thoughts,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ δὴ ὁμοφρονέοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					9.456
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμοφρονέοντε νοήμασιν . . , ἀνὴρ
				ἠδὲ γυνή</span>
			<i>in unity</i> of purposes, <i><span class="en">
				6.183
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἕλληνας ὁμοφρονέοντας</span>”
				<i>being all of one mind,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					9.2
				</span></i>
			 ; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνώμῃ διενειχθέντας,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				7.229
			</span></i> ; of conspirators, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				7.5.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				14.3
			</span></i> ; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεμος ὁμοφρονέων</span>
			a war <i>of common consent,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				8.3
			</span></i> : c. dat., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ γὰρ ἀλλήλοισι
				ὁμοφρονέουσι</span>
			<i>are</i> ont <i>agreed</i> together, ib.<i><span class="en">
				75
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
